<p>Superior cunning and training allows you to outthink and outwit your opponents' physical and mental assaults.  Increases Defense by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100,<br>Cunning 100">13, 17, 20, 23, 25</acronym> and Mental Save by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100,<br>Cunning 100">13, 17, 20, 23, 25.</acronym></p><p>The Defense bonus will scale with your Dexterity, and the save bonus with your Cunning.</p>